step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test the best single model FT_rf as a baseline to compare against pool strategies.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"FT_rf"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse error weights on the most stable pool (pool1) to see if it beats the best single FT_rf.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["CWT_rf","DWT_rf","FT_rf","DWT_catboost","FT_catboost"],"weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a median combination on the most stable 5 models (pool1) to see if robust central tendency beats current best.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a median combination on pool2 to see if adding ONLY_CWT_rf improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a dynamic Bayesian aggregation on the larger pool3 to see if it improves over simple mean/median.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool3","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a trimmed_mean on pool4 with 20% trimming to see if reducing extreme models improves performance.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool4","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a median combination on pool3 to see if a more robust central tendency on a larger pool improves over previous bests.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Test a simple mean over pool4 to see if averaging the most stable set improves over weighted inverse_error.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a simple median over pool4 to see if it improves over mean pool4 and trimmed_mean pool4.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a DBA combination on pool1 to see if iterative refinement beats current best.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a dba combination on pool2 to see if it can beat the current best single FT_rf.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool2","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Evaluate a dba combination on pool4 to see if it beats current best while using a different algorithm.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool4","dba_max_iter":30}

